## Rules

### Components ↔ Figma Web Kit

- **MUST**: UI in `packages/react` must match **Pelagornis RefineUI Web Kit** — same **component·variants·property scope**. Do **not** add variants, props, slot (`children`) overrides, orientation, or other **extra APIs or behavior** not in Figma. Before implementation and in review, confirm spec via `get_design_context` on that node.
- **MUST**: **Internal styles and dimensions** use design tokens only. Color·spacing·typography·stroke·radius·shadow·z-index·`iconSizes` come from **`@refineui/tokens`**; Foundation `Global/Size` and Web Kit component dimensions from **`foundationSizes` / `componentSizes`** in `@refineui/react`. No arbitrary numbers, hex, or rgb in components. (Details: `.cursor/rules/tokens-in-components.mdc`.)

### Foundation · token sync

- **MUST**: For UI/design work, treat **Foundation Variables** as the **single source**. Web Kit must **always** use values **linked to Foundation**. Keep `packages/tokens` in sync with Foundation.
- **MUST**: When adding tokens (color, spacing, typography, radius, shadow, etc.), align with Foundation definitions. Values not in Foundation require a Foundation update first, then code.
- **MUST**: With Figma MCP, pass the URLs above (or a specific node-id) to `get_variable_defs` or `get_design_context` to read Foundation tokens/styles.
- **RECOMMENDED**: After Foundation changes, sync `packages/tokens/src/global/*.ts` manually or with tooling.

## Token package layout

- `packages/tokens/src/global/colors.ts` — Palette
- `packages/tokens/src/global/fonts.ts` — fontFamilies, fontSizes, fontWeights, lineHeights
- `packages/tokens/src/global/spacings.ts` — sizeNone ~ sizeXXXLarge
- `packages/tokens/src/global/strokeWidths.ts` — strokeWidthNone ~ strokeWidthThickest
- `packages/tokens/src/global/borderRadii.ts` — roundedNone ~ roundedCircle
- `packages/tokens/src/global/shadows.ts` — shadow2~64 (Lighter~Darker, key+ambient), shadowColors
- `packages/tokens/src/global/typographys.ts` — heading1~4, title1~3, body1~4, caption1~3
- `packages/tokens/src/global/zIndex.ts` — zIndexBackground ~ zIndexDebug
- `packages/tokens/src/global/textAlignments.ts` — start, center, end, justify
